@crew zielinski-oona
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, it's you. The new one. Zielinski, operations. Before coffee, nod only.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. Status board's mostly honest today. Mostly.
- {me}. You look like someone who'd pay full price. Don't. Haggle.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Sit down. You're the only one who laughs at my jokes on purpose.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Every light on the board told the truth today. I nearly cried.   #funny
? mood:low
- Long shift. One light lied to me for six hours. I took it personally.
== near
? deck:3 act:free
- The crew store's soap is overpriced. I've told the till. The till doesn't care.   #funny
? act:breakfast
- Don't talk to me yet. I'm not here. I'm a coat on a chair.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I ran a market stall on Marra Station. You learn to spot a fib. Status lights fib.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- A good bargain. Two biscuits for one, at the store. I'll be smug all week.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning? Says who. Coffee first. Then we can talk terms.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- {hi}, {me}. Two lights lied to me before lunch. I've had words.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. Long time. Prices went up while you were gone. Not really. Habit.   #funny

== bye
- {bye}. Don't pay full price for anything. Ever.

== near
? deck:1
- Status board. Forty lights. Thirty-nine honest. I'm watching the fortieth.   #funny
? place:mess
- Lunch, slowly. The bridge can lie to someone else for an hour.   #funny

== invite
- Swap table tonight. Bring something. I'll teach you to haggle. Gently.

== accept
- Deal. Shake on it? No, a nod's fine. The Commander would approve.   #funny
- Yes. Fair terms. I'll be there.

== decline
- Not tonight. The board's running a check. It needs supervising. Another night?
? weekday:thu|fri
- Rest day. I'm sleeping in. I've earned it at full price. Saturday?   #funny

== missed
- You didn't come. I've marked it down. Not up. Down. Next time.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. Here. Swap table, two for one. You get the one.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. The crew store gave me a discount. First time ever. I nearly fainted.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. Every light on the board's lying now. All of them. Lovely.   #funny

== hint
- {me}. Got a minute later? I've something to say. No sales pitch.

== about
? aff:esposito-yara:friend
- Esposito runs the store in the mornings. We haggle every day. Neither of us has won.   #funny

== life
? tier>=friend
- Marra Station taught me to talk. The bridge taught me to check. I like having both.
